SUMMARY:Mark Twain Tonight! A Special One-night Only Performance
LOCATION:Town Hall\, Midtown-Times Square
DESCRIPTION:For one night only Richard Thomas performs the acclaimed Mark T
 
wain Tonight! by Hal Holbrook to benefit the Entertainment Community Fund. 
 
Emmy Award winning actor and 2025 Theater Hall of Fame inductee Richard Tho
 
mas brings to life Mark Twain The nation's one true comic genius The New Yo
 
rk Times In this celebrated theatrical event followed by a special talkback
 
 with Prizewinning and bestselling author of eight works of history and bio
 
graphy Ron Chernow. Through Twain's wit humor and timeless observations Tho
 
mas captures the spirit of one of Americas most beloved literary voices. Mo
 
st recently seen on Broadway in Our Town and The Balusters 2026 Tony Award 
 
nominee Thomas is the first and only actor authorized to perform Mark Twain
 
 Tonight! since the original production. 100 percent of net proceeds will b
 
enefit the Entertainment Community Fund supporting performing arts and ente
 
rtainment professionals in need. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.c
 
om/mark-twain-tonight-a-special-onenight-new-york-new-york-11-02-2026/event
 
/03006532AAE730FF
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.com/mark-twain-tonight-a-special-onenight-new-
 
york-new-york-11-02-2026/event/03006532AAE730FF
END:VEVENT
