BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-20261102-23@tonight
DTSTAMP:20261102T140324Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261102T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261102T210000
SUMMARY:Salisha Thomas: The Possibility Project
LOCATION:Birdland Jazz Club\, Hell's Kitchen
DESCRIPTION:NEW YORK\, NY Broadway star and acclaimed vocalist Salisha Thom
 
as will bring The Possibility Project to Birdland Jazz Club on Monday\, Nov
 
ember 2 at 7:00 PM. An intimate evening of music\, storytelling\, and inspi
 
ration\, The Possibility Project traces Thomass journey from Disney to Broa
 
dway and beyond through the songs\, artists\, and experiences that have hel
 
ped shape her life and career.Featuring beloved music associated with Carol
 
e King\, Lena Horne\, and other legendary artists\, the evening combines pe
 
rsonal stories with songs that celebrate ambition\, resilience\, reinventio
 
n\, and the unexpected turns that can lead to extraordinary places. At the 
 
heart of The Possibility Project is a simple idea: the life youre dreaming 
 
about may be closer than you think. Salisha Thomas is a Broadway actress\, 
 
singer\, producer\, author\, and host. She made her Broadway debut in Beaut
 
iful: The Carole King Musical before starring in Once Upon a One More Time.
 
 She has performed alongside Hugh Jackman at Radio City Music Hall\, the Ho
 
llywood Bowl\, and arenas across North America. Thomas is also the author o
 
f Why Be a 9 When You Can Be a 10 and the creator and host of The Salisha S
 
how podcast\, where she brings her trademark curiosity and enthusiasm to co
 
nversations about creativity\, career\, and living life to its fullest pote
 
ntial. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/salisha-thomas-the-p
 
ossibility-project-birdland-jazz-club-tickets/14278884
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/salisha-thomas-the-possibility-project-
 
birdland-jazz-club-tickets/14278884
END:VEVENT
